# --- Generated output -------------------------------------------------------
# by-figures/ is a re-arranged *copy* of every <unit>/figures/*.png (462 files,
# ~116 MB of byte-identical duplicates). It is rebuilt from scratch by
# scripts/network-analysis/current-version/4_group_and_cross_comparison.ipynb,
# so it is kept out of version control.
analysis/network-analysis/by-figures/

# The 15 report PDFs (~47 MB) duplicate analysis/final-summarized-reports/markdown/,
# which GitHub renders directly in the browser. They are published as release
# assets instead, so cloning the repository does not drag them along:
#   https://github.com/brianwen818/grad-school-network-analysis/releases/latest
analysis/final-summarized-reports/pdf/

